message: "If you cite Session Bench, please use this metadata."
title: "Session Bench: the coding-agent session-format benchmark"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Malakhov
    given-names: Alexander
version: "0.3"
date-released: "2026-08-12"
url: "https://jazzyalex.github.io/agent-sessions/bench/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jazzyalex/session-bench"
abstract: >-
  A pass/fail benchmark of coding-agent session formats: whether harnesses
  preserve a useful, inspectable, stable, and open record of their work.
  SWE-bench measures whether the agent completed the work; Session Bench
  measures what the harness preserved after the work was done.
